1
00:01:04,560 --> 00:01:05,359
Brother.

2
00:01:05,359 --> 00:01:07,040
Aren't we moving a bit too fast?

3
00:01:07,079 --> 00:01:08,719
Should we wait for the team behind us?

4
00:01:09,959 --> 00:01:11,040
Let's stop for now.

5
00:01:13,879 --> 00:01:16,560
Zhang Tianyou made our Wan Family lead,

6
00:01:17,400 --> 00:01:19,840
to use your Yin-Yang Eyes to spot danger.

7
00:01:20,120 --> 00:01:23,560
He really treats us like his servants.

8
00:01:23,680 --> 00:01:24,920
I trust Brother Tianyou.

9
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:27,079
He will lead us to the Tidal Tomb.

10
00:01:30,120 --> 00:01:31,680
Let's wait here for the main group.

11
00:01:31,680 --> 00:01:32,480
Take a break.

12
00:01:35,719 --> 00:01:36,400
Chun'er,

13
00:01:36,920 --> 00:01:38,959
don't trust Zhang Tianyou too easily.

14
00:01:39,319 --> 00:01:43,439
I'm the only one you can trust here.

15
00:01:46,719 --> 00:01:47,519
Chun'er?

16
00:01:48,359 --> 00:01:49,159
Brother,

17
00:01:50,079 --> 00:01:54,000
don't these guys seem a bit off to you?

18
00:02:05,359 --> 00:02:06,840
Is there something wrong with this forest,

19
00:02:08,080 --> 00:02:09,439
or...

20
00:02:18,439 --> 00:02:21,240
Zhang Tianyou, is this the right way?

21
00:02:21,800 --> 00:02:24,800
The Wan Family has been ahead for a while.

22
00:02:26,759 --> 00:02:28,439
Only when we reach the general vicinity

23
00:02:28,439 --> 00:02:30,719
can the Dragon-Seeking Ruler pinpoint it.

24
00:02:34,039 --> 00:02:36,360
The Qi Family is struggling in the rear.

25
00:02:36,520 --> 00:02:38,240
Let's wait and take a short break.

26
00:02:44,280 --> 00:02:45,240
What's wrong, Father?

27
00:02:49,159 --> 00:02:52,439
Wan Family leads, Qi Family at the rear.

28
00:02:52,960 --> 00:02:56,560
It's just like twenty years ago, isn't it?

29
00:02:57,840 --> 00:03:00,080
Except twenty years ago,

30
00:03:00,080 --> 00:03:05,159
Not just the Mei Family and Sheng Family.

31
00:03:15,400 --> 00:03:17,360
Rat Bro, go scout ahead.

32
00:03:17,599 --> 00:03:18,879
Slow the Wan Family down.

33
00:03:18,879 --> 00:03:19,680
Got it.

34
00:03:31,879 --> 00:03:32,400
Li Xiao

35
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:33,560
Stop chasing him.

36
00:03:33,879 --> 00:03:34,759
Let him run.

37
00:03:35,520 --> 00:03:37,000
With his death-seeking nature,

38
00:03:37,520 --> 00:03:39,479
I'm sure he'll follow right behind us.

39
00:03:48,039 --> 00:03:49,639
Family Head, it's Li Xiao.

40
00:03:49,960 --> 00:03:51,039
I saw.

41
00:03:51,719 --> 00:03:52,800
Tianyou said

42
00:03:52,800 --> 00:03:54,680
the treasures left in this tomb

43
00:03:54,680 --> 00:03:56,520
Marshal Li has coveted for over 20 years.

44
00:03:56,520 --> 00:03:57,879
He won't give up easily.

45
00:03:59,280 --> 00:04:00,280
Let's keep moving.

46
00:04:00,680 --> 00:04:01,479
Yes.

47
00:04:11,319 --> 00:04:12,319
I'll go check on Rat.

48
00:04:15,759 --> 00:04:16,319
This...

49
00:04:38,519 --> 00:04:39,519
Family Head.

50
00:04:39,600 --> 00:04:41,000
Let's just wait here.

51
00:04:46,560 --> 00:04:47,560
Brother.

52
00:04:47,560 --> 00:04:49,720
Look, their movements are synchronized.

53
00:05:14,240 --> 00:05:16,920
The miasma here is making them delirious.

54
00:05:19,160 --> 00:05:20,600
Chun'er, the Soul-Startling Whistle!

55
00:05:32,759 --> 00:05:33,560
Father

56
00:05:34,399 --> 00:05:36,480
Maybe I should go take a look too.

57
00:05:37,439 --> 00:05:39,399
Wait here for a moment. Don't move.

58
00:05:39,399 --> 00:05:40,199
Father!

59
00:05:42,399 --> 00:05:43,240
Zhang Tianyou.

60
00:05:46,519 --> 00:05:47,319
What's wrong?

61
00:05:48,160 --> 00:05:50,959
In the past, the Sheng Family and I

62
00:05:50,959 --> 00:05:52,800
did a lot of things to wrong you.

63
00:05:53,439 --> 00:05:55,120
We hurt your pride.

64
00:05:56,160 --> 00:05:57,199
Actually, I...

65
00:05:59,040 --> 00:06:00,920
Where did Rat Bro go?

66
00:06:13,279 --> 00:06:14,240
Actually, about that...

67
00:06:14,240 --> 00:06:15,560
You don't need to say this.

68
00:06:15,759 --> 00:06:17,120
It's not like I hold grudges.

69
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:20,279
Of course I know you don't hold grudges.

70
00:06:20,560 --> 00:06:22,600
Or you wouldn't have brought us here.

71
00:06:28,560 --> 00:06:29,560
This is a letter of divorce.

72
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:32,079
From now on,

73
00:06:32,959 --> 00:06:34,120
we have nothing to do with each other.

74
00:06:38,800 --> 00:06:39,600
Also,

75
00:06:40,319 --> 00:06:41,839
I want to remind you,

76
00:06:42,720 --> 00:06:43,680
Mei Yuanhe.

77
00:06:53,319 --> 00:06:54,120
Rat Bro!

78
00:07:02,360 --> 00:07:03,160
What's going on?

79
00:07:16,279 --> 00:07:16,920
Something's wrong.

80
00:07:16,920 --> 00:07:17,519
Gro...

81
00:07:17,519 --> 00:07:18,560
Ground rat!

82
00:07:19,199 --> 00:07:20,000
You...

83
00:07:20,519 --> 00:07:21,480
What... What's wrong with me?

84
00:07:21,480 --> 00:07:22,160
You...

85
00:07:22,160 --> 00:07:23,120
Weren't you just...

86
00:07:29,720 --> 00:07:30,519
Let go!

87
00:07:38,079 --> 00:07:38,879
Father, hurry and save him!

88
00:07:40,360 --> 00:07:41,160
Zhang Tianyou!

89
00:07:43,040 --> 00:07:45,160
It's the miasma in the woods!

90
00:07:45,160 --> 00:07:46,079
Hurry, save him!

91
00:07:46,079 --> 00:07:46,639
Let go!

92
00:07:46,639 --> 00:07:48,639
Zhang Tianyou!

93
00:07:51,279 --> 00:07:53,120
Zhang Tianyou, I'm Jiushuang!

94
00:07:53,120 --> 00:07:55,160
Zhang Tianyou, let go!

95
00:07:58,839 --> 00:07:59,639
Zhang Tianyou!

96
00:08:01,120 --> 00:08:01,920
Wake up!

97
00:08:02,279 --> 00:08:03,079
Wake up!

98
00:08:03,079 --> 00:08:04,360
Tianyou!

99
00:08:05,040 --> 00:08:05,839
Are you okay?

100
00:08:06,439 --> 00:08:07,240
Tianyou!

101
00:08:07,800 --> 00:08:08,360
Feeling better?

102
00:08:10,319 --> 00:08:10,879
Here.

103
00:08:14,399 --> 00:08:17,399
Chief, how did even you get affected?

104
00:08:17,399 --> 00:08:18,639
This shouldn't have happened.

105
00:08:23,800 --> 00:08:26,160
What? I'm not dead.

106
00:08:26,959 --> 00:08:31,040
Means we're closer to our destination.

107
00:08:31,560 --> 00:08:34,600
The closer we get, the weirder it gets.

108
00:08:38,600 --> 00:08:39,799
If you're all like this,

109
00:08:40,519 --> 00:08:42,480
the Wan Family siblings must be in danger.

110
00:08:43,159 --> 00:08:44,000
We have to hurry and save them.

111
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:44,799
Wait.

112
00:08:46,480 --> 00:08:47,799
We're almost there now.

113
00:08:48,360 --> 00:08:51,720
Our priority is to lose our tail.

114
00:08:53,480 --> 00:08:54,799
Family Head Mei.

115
00:08:54,799 --> 00:08:57,159
Take men to find the Wan Family siblings.

116
00:08:58,039 --> 00:08:59,960
You two, come with me.

117
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:02,600
Jiushuang, don't go with him.

118
00:09:03,120 --> 00:09:03,919
Jiushuang.

119
00:09:04,200 --> 00:09:05,000
Uncle Mei,

120
00:09:06,440 --> 00:09:09,080
worried Zhang Tianyou will harm her?

121
00:09:18,159 --> 00:09:19,279
Don't shoot!

122
00:09:20,279 --> 00:09:21,840
Put your guns down!

123
00:09:21,840 --> 00:09:22,399
Father!

124
00:09:22,480 --> 00:09:24,399
I sneaked back when they weren't looking.

125
00:09:24,399 --> 00:09:24,639
Good.

126
00:09:24,639 --> 00:09:25,039
Father,

127
00:09:25,039 --> 00:09:26,240
you have no idea.

128
00:09:26,240 --> 00:09:27,720
I totally fooled them.

129
00:09:28,639 --> 00:09:30,480
We just need to follow them quietly,

130
00:09:30,639 --> 00:09:31,919
and we'll locate the Tidal Tomb.

131
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:35,399
Good boy!

132
00:09:35,399 --> 00:09:37,200
I knew you could do it.

133
00:09:38,240 --> 00:09:41,279
For brains, it's gotta be you.

134
00:09:42,120 --> 00:09:43,080
If your Father

135
00:09:43,120 --> 00:09:44,480
had been as smart as you,

136
00:09:44,519 --> 00:09:45,720
twenty years ago,

137
00:09:45,720 --> 00:09:47,679
I wouldn't have made a wasted trip.

138
00:09:49,279 --> 00:09:49,960
By the way,

139
00:09:49,960 --> 00:09:52,080
are those idiots actually capable?

140
00:09:52,159 --> 00:09:53,039
If not,

141
00:09:53,039 --> 00:09:56,279
I'll have men level this place with bombs.

142
00:09:56,279 --> 00:09:58,519
There's no way we won't find that tomb.

143
00:09:58,679 --> 00:09:59,399
Father,

144
00:09:59,960 --> 00:10:01,120
we're here for archaeology,

145
00:10:01,120 --> 00:10:02,279
not to wipe out bandits.

146
00:10:02,600 --> 00:10:03,879
Right, right.

147
00:10:03,879 --> 00:10:04,519
Okay,

148
00:10:04,600 --> 00:10:05,840
we'll do as you say.

149
00:10:08,159 --> 00:10:09,200
What are you standing around for?

150
00:10:09,399 --> 00:10:12,120
Send a few men ahead, left and right,

151
00:10:12,120 --> 00:10:13,519
to scout the area!

152
00:10:13,519 --> 00:10:15,039
What if someone snipes at us?

153
00:10:15,039 --> 00:10:16,000
Yes, Marshal.

154
00:10:20,120 --> 00:10:21,120
Father,

155
00:10:21,120 --> 00:10:22,759
aren't you being too cautious?

156
00:10:22,879 --> 00:10:24,480
Out here, how could there be...

157
00:10:34,559 --> 00:10:35,840
Marshal! Young Master!

158
00:10:35,840 --> 00:10:36,799
There's something...

159
00:10:37,159 --> 00:10:38,320
There's something in the woods ahead!

160
00:10:39,159 --> 00:10:39,639
What?

161
00:10:39,639 --> 00:10:40,480
Xiao Liu Zi...

162
00:10:40,679 --> 00:10:41,960
Xiao Liu Zi was dragged away!

163
00:10:41,960 --> 00:10:42,240
Wait.

164
00:10:42,240 --> 00:10:43,480
What was it? Tell me!

165
00:10:43,480 --> 00:10:44,080
A white shadow...

166
00:10:44,639 --> 00:10:45,399
It was a white blur.

167
00:10:46,200 --> 00:10:47,639
It... it was incredibly strong.

168
00:10:48,039 --> 00:10:49,360
Right down in that hollow.

169
00:10:50,720 --> 00:10:51,639
The hollow?

170
00:11:10,960 --> 00:11:12,399
What... what are you doing?
